 "applies_to": "Discontinued Reznor ZQYRA ventilation units (energy recovery wheel with heat pump) fitted with the BACnet MS/TP option BHB8.",
 "summary": "ZQYRA is a discontinued Reznor ventilation unit with an energy recovery wheel and a heat pump. With option BHB8 its controller is reachable on BACnet MS/TP. The BMS can switch the unit on and off, shut it down, reset alarms and runtimes, and write dewpoint changeover and discharge, outdoor and zone changeover setpoints. It reads zone, outdoor, discharge and exhaust temperatures and dewpoints, unit mode, the on/off command source, compressor and heating output, runtimes, digital inputs, relays and alarms.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
