  "The R/W column is printed once per group; it is carried down to the rows below it.",
  "Ranges and defaults are shown as printed; where the range cell spans several rows it is only given on the first.",
  "Some setpoints only apply in one temperature control type (TempCntrl, AV 1010): OA changeover (1), OA reset (2) or space changeover (3).",
  "Alarm BVs are marked critical, cripple or general in the table.",
  "Engineering units are taken from the range column where printed.",
  "Source: Table 45 BACnet MSTP Points List, IOM pages 68-69."
